<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 104 0 R/T(Why input\(\) returns a string: the keyboard \(standard input\) delivers characters; Python cannot know whether '10' is a number, an ID or a name. The program decides the type by converting explicitly. Conversion: int\('12'\) gives 12, float\('8.5'\) gives 8.5. int\('8.5'\) raises ValueError.)/E(Why input\(\) returns a string: the keyboard \(standard input\) delivers characters; Python cannot know whether '10' is a number, an ID or a name. The program decides the type by converting explicitly. Conversion: int\('12'\) gives 12, float\('8.5'\) gives 8.5. int\('8.5'\) raises ValueError.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

528 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 104 0 R/T(Invalid values: float\('8,5'\) and float\('eight'\) raise ValueError. A program must catch it rather than crash. Validation: either check the text first \(string methods\) or convert inside try/except; then check the range \(for example 2.0 <= fat <= 7.0\).)/E(Invalid values: float\('8,5'\) and float\('eight'\) raise ValueError. A program must catch it rather than crash. Validation: either check the text first \(string methods\) or convert inside try/except; then check the range \(for example 2.0 <= fat <= 7.0\).)/Pg 17 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

