1038 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 113 0 R/T(The program reads the file once at start-up and converts values to Decimal \(store them as strings or use parse_float=Decimal; plain JSON floats would reintroduce binary error\). Start-up cost: O\(t\) time and space for t rate values - microseconds to milliseconds for a handful of values. Maintenance: a rate revision is a text edit with no code change and no redistribution of the program, which is a big saving when many offices use it; the risks are typing errors or a missing file, so the loader must validate the values and fail clearly. Embedded constants are simpler and safer for a single small deployment; a JSON file is better when rates change often or the program runs at many centres.)/E(The program reads the file once at start-up and converts values to Decimal \(store them as strings or use parse_float=Decimal; plain JSON floats would reintroduce binary error\). Start-up cost: O\(t\) time and space for t rate values - microseconds to milliseconds for a handful of values. Maintenance: a rate revision is a text edit with no code change and no redistribution of the program, which is a big saving when many offices use it; the risks are typing errors or a missing file, so the loader must validate the values and fail clearly. Embedded constants are simpler and safer for a single small deployment; a JSON file is better when rates change often or the program runs at many centres.)/Pg 26 0 R/K[24]>>
endobj

