<</Title(Python does not enforce constants. The last lines of the program rebind BASE_RATE to 99.0 without any error. Python relies on the convention: a programmer seeing UPPER_CASE knows the value must not be reassigned. Tools \(linters, type checkers\) can warn about it.)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2007 0 R/Prev 2084 0 R/Next 2085 0 R>>
