2127 0 obj
<</Title(Precedence \(high to low\): ** , unary + -, * / // %, binary + -, comparisons, not, and, or. Operators of the same level group left to right \(left-associative\), but ** is right-associative: 2**3**2 = 2**\(3**2\) = 512. Unary minus vs **: ** binds tighter than unary minus on its left, so -2**2 = -\(2**2\) = -4, while \(-2\)**2 = 4. Comparison chaining: 2.0 <= fat <= 7.0 means \(2.0 <= fat\) and \(fat <= 7.0\), with fat evaluated once. Boolean operators and / or / not combine conditions and short-circuit.)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2091 0 R/Next 2160 0 R>>
endobj

2128 0 obj
<</Title(round\(\), int\(\), math.floor\(\) for negatives: round\(-2.5\) = -2 \(nearest, half to even\); int\(-2.5\) = -2 \(truncates toward zero\); floor\(-2.5\) = -3 \(toward minus infinity\).)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2091 0 R/Prev 2160 0 R>>
endobj

