<</Title(Manual calculation of the five-entry set: 300.00 + 283.90 + 333.60 + 20 x 32.30 \(4.0 fat, 8.6 snf: 30 + 5x0.40 + 1x0.30\) = 646.00 + 5 x 30.10 \(3.6 fat, 8.4 snf: 30 + 0.40 - 0.30\) = 150.50, total 1714.00.)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2097 0 R/Prev 2141 0 R>>
