<</Title(Three unexpected results observed: \(1\) \(4.2-3.5\)/0.1 = 7.000000000000002; \(2\) \(3.1-3.5\)/0.1 = -3.999999999999999; \(3\) \(8.7-8.5\)/0.1 = 1.999999999999993. \(The exact tail depends on the numbers; the result is near, not equal to, the integer.\) A fourth surprise: round\(-2.5\) = -2 because Python rounds halves to the even number.)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2091 0 R/Prev 2127 0 R/Next 2128 0 R>>
